    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p><strong>Question ID:</strong> ALG2_U04_L02_Q03</p><p><strong>MLA Standard:</strong> MLA.A2.EX.2; MLA.A2.EX.3</p><p>A value starts at 600 and grows by 3% each year. Which model fits?</p>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
